Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Change... history?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... I want you to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That this unsalvageable ruin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That this tragedy devoid of all hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...can be made to never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard people say\Nhistory will correct itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did the people who propose that\Nchange time and show proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how large the world is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the only one who can interfere with time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is me, Kurumi Tokisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In which case, that which you see\Nwith your eyes before you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is the only one truth that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll really be able to save Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That all depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do this, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:06.62,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cutting through this way is faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, um... Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Come back, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot, I can't be wasting time here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What now? What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.99,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did anyone sketchy come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I haven't seen anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say hi to your mom for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Phew, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good thinking there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't believe Natsumi's transformation\Npowers actually came in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looking like that, no one will\Nbat an eye seeing you in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, but how do I go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's cute, so why even bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That must be Kotori's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl defies time and changes into a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All by himself, a boy\Ncontests a repeat disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:23.99,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Nine:\N'Tengu City, Five Years Ago'"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chase after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's me! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami! Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad... Mom...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm all right. More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I swear, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someday, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell... is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone like Origami to become like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew something significant\Nhad to have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yod Bet must have reached its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She went back to her original time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She wasn't able to change history?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you okay, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad... Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right! It'll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, someday you're realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of this, the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But please don't forget! You're not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of your sadness and hate--\NI'll carry all of it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're lost, lean on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When something happens and\Nit's too much, rely on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything... It's okay\Nto dump everything on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So... So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let despair take over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I live in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you mean everything you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, this is the last time I cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's also the last time I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All my sadness and joy...\NAll the fun in my life, I give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, this anger... This anger is mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, carry all of it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until I kill the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's how it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How ironic to happen this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. You even used Yod Bet\Non me to fix all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I'm referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who killed her parents\Nwas Origami herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This whole situation wouldn't have\Nhappened if not for my Zaphkiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's a fact which is\Nincredibly upsetting to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, it's not like you used Zaphkiel\Nhoping for this to happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it doesn't matter\N'cuz it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,True. As far as that world\Nis concerned, what's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, I was just presented a method\Nto overturn that a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Presented? By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By you a few dozen minutes from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The future me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because the method isn't available to you\Nwho returned to your original time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So for me right now, there's still\Na way I can save Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's not over just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed. It's about time we\Nsacked this shithole of a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. I'll do anything to save Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Attaboy, that's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? What's the method?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's quite simple in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just have you try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The main reason you were unable\Nto do anything to stop Origami
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,was because you had no idea\Nwhat would happen to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So now that I know, you want\Nto use Yod Bet on me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An interesting guess,\Nbut I'm afraid that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As it stands now, I'm simply\Nsharing your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't physically interact with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's one thing...\NOne single method that only I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not every day that a guest\Nstumbles upon us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone to know me and my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You, five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, five years ago I \Nwas also near the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just checking what the blaze was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I figured a Spirit might be\Npart of an inferno that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Then if you were \Nthere five years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You'll have me shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Yod Bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, I need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not move without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't guarantee you'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Shido Itsuka. I came\Nfrom five years in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, using your powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If this is some sort of joke--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness, the old me \Nsure is quite cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, do you think you could\Nhave that me touch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, you can keep that gun on me,\Nbut will you come touch my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi says she wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it odd if I start with\N"Long time no see," old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Interesting... You have\Nmy voice, so that's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're saying you want me to point\NYod Bet at him and shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's precisely what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's me asking, I can't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, come to me, Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zaphkiel, Yod Bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, shall we proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, this time, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.41,0:14:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish you good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume you have a plan then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.77,0:15:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're letting this all go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't blame me! I haven't had time to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, you and I know\Nexactly what's about to occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So how about preventing Origami\Nfrom realizing who killed her parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I considered that, too, but it doesn't\Nchange the fact that her parents die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, as long as her parents\Nare killed by the hands of a Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami's grudge might fall\Non someone else instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On Kotori, who caused the inferno...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or otherwise, Phantom,\Nwho gave her that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you thinking, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't it work out if Origami appears\Nbut there's no enemy in sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's possible, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.12,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"West Tengu Park"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, you're creeping around like a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I imagine you understand this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mustn't interact with Kotori, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:40.60,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"West Tengu Park"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tamper with history more than needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one I came here to save is Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try to restrain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for you, Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be... You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That reaction was unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that someone you know, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't say I know anyone who\Ncensors their whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:18:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought your big plan\Nwould be to chat with Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I think that's very like you to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't say I recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one is impossible to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know Phantom or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Phantom, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that the name I was given?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for running off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it better to do this away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... I knew you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't my real appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't show you what\NI truly look like just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know who I am or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You used a time-travel bullet to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't just for fun, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, I'll get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a poetic way to \Nsay you came to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't about killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want you to hide, and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but my answer is "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There're still a few things I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Origami is about to--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why... does this feel so familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When the time is right, let's meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I will never let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't make that mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that happen again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will... make it change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami... Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad... Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No use. It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi? Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I... do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami and... her parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:41.54,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Ten:\N'Another World, Another Girl'"
